					<h1 class="title" title="Theme Parks in India">Theme Parks in India</h1>
					<div class="entry-content">


<p>As India is progressing continuously the trend of <b>theme parks in India</b> is also increasing. These parks in India can be considered as the <b>best place for entertainment</b> for middle-class and higher-class families. Some of the <b>famous parks in India</b> are:</p>

<strong>&#187; Veegaland Park</strong>

<p>This Park is in <b>Kakanand, Cochin</b>. Veegaland Park has no seasonal limitation and can be visited throughout the year. It can be reached through either cabs or bus services. <b>Timings of Veegaland Park</b> are from 10:30 in the morning till 06:30 in the evening. Its main attractions are <b>Musical Dancing Fountain</b> and <b>Vintage Castle</b>.
<strong>&#187; Ocean Park</strong>
<p>Park is located at <b>Osman Sagar Road, Gandipet, Hyderabad</b>. Best season to visit the Park is from September to March every season. Can be reached by cabs or buses. Ocean Park gets opened at around 11:00 in the morning and is closed at 08:00 in the evening. Its main attractions are <b>Free Loop Ride</b> and The Rides</p>
<strong>&#187; Ramoji Film City</strong>
<p>Located in <b>Vijayawada</b> which is 25 Kms away from the city of <b>Hyderabad</b>. It has its name mentioned in <b>Guinness Book of World Records</b> as the <b>largest film city in the world</b>. Opened 7 days a week this film city was built in 1996 by the <b>Producer Ramoji Rao</b>. Entry fee for this park is Rs. 200/- per adult person and its visiting hours are from 09:00 in the morning till 06:00 in the evening. Ramoji Film City is also a wonder among <b>seven wonders of Hyderabad City</b>.</p>

<strong>&#187; Essel World </strong>
<p>Located at <b>Gorai Beach Island, Borivali (W), Mumbai. Essel World</b> is Mumbai's <b>largest water theme park</b> with several water rides. Spread over the area of more than 30 acres this theme park can be entered by paying Rs. 200/- as an entry fee per adult person. Since Essel World is <b>water theme park</b>, best time to visit the place is from June to February. Its opening time is 11:00 in the morning till 07:00 in the evening. Special features of this park are <b>Ice Skating</b> and <b>Rikis Rocking Alley</b>.</p>
<strong>&#187; Gujrat Science City</strong>
<p>Located at Village <b>Hebatpur, Sola-Santej Road, Sarkhej Gandhinagar Highway, Ahmedabad</b>. As its name says this park is built to impart advanced science knowledge to the people. With many hands-on labs and demo projects this theme park is one of its kinds. Because it is <b>educational theme park</b> there is no entry fee till date.</p>

<p>Above are few <b>theme parks of India</b> and there are many more which are yet to be mentioned but the above are main parks which are 'must-visit' type of places.</p>



 
